<title>JAPAN: Ryomo Systems - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ryomo Systems - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.11		vs	    3.61</p>
<p> Operating	  141 million	 vs	  107 million</p>
<p> Current	     36 million	 vs	   43 million</p>
<p> Net		   23 million	 vs	   18 million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.80 yen	  vs	    5.40 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ryomo Systems Co Ltd is involved in system development and dataprocessing.</p>
